"Some plugins and/or themes are injecting a ob (caching) operation and this "
"can harm the PDF generation. If you experience, that your PDF ticket is not "
"rendered, you can try to activate this option. But it can slow down a bit "
"your wordpress installation!"
msgstr ""
"Nogle plugins og/eller temaer injicerer en ob (cache)-handling, og det kan "
"skade PDF-genereringen. Hvis du oplever, at din PDF-billet ikke vises, kan "
"du prøve at aktivere denne indstilling. Men det kan gøre din WordPress-"
"installation en smule langsommere!"

#: backend.js:3926
msgid ""
"Some systems are slow and the connection timeout interrupts the export, if "
"you have too many tickets. In that case, you can export your tickets in "
"several steps. e.g. 0 and 20000 amount and then 20001 and 20000 amount."
msgstr ""
"Nogle systemer er langsomme, og forbindelsens timeout afbryder eksporten, "
"hvis du har for mange billetter. I så fald kan du eksportere dine billetter "
"i flere trin. f.eks. 0 og 20000 antal og derefter 20001 og 20000 antal."

