#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: index.php
msgid "Event Tickets with Ticket Scanner"
msgstr "Event Tickets med Ticket Scanner"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: index.php
msgid "https://vollstart.com/event-tickets-with-ticket-scanner/docs/"
msgstr "https://vollstart.com/event-tickets-with-ticket-scanner/docs/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: index.php
msgid ""
"You can create and generate tickets and codes. You can redeem the tickets at"
" entrance using the built-in ticket scanner. You customer can download a PDF"
" with the ticket information. The Premium allows you also to activate user "
"registration and more. This allows your user to register them self to a "
"ticket."
msgstr ""
"Du kan oprette og generere billetter og koder. Du kan indløse billetterne "
"ved indgangen ved hjælp af den indbyggede ticket scanner. Din kunde kan "
"downloade en PDF med billetinformation. Premium giver dig også mulighed for "
"at aktivere brugerregistrering og mere. Det giver dine brugere mulighed for "
"selv at registrere sig til en billet."

#. Author of the plugin
#: index.php
msgid "Vollstart"
msgstr "Vollstart"

#. Author URI of the plugin
